    "answer": "The claim is defined as the constant `CUSTOMER_NUMBER_CLAIM = 'customer_number'` in `apps/api/src/oauth/customerIdentity.ts`. In the same file, `identityFromClaims` reads that claim to build the customer identity. The stand-in login in `apps/api/src/dummyPortal/dummyIssuer.ts` imports the constant and writes the claim into its tokens. `createCustomerScopeResolver` in `apps/api/src/tools/toolAuth.ts` takes the customer number from the verified bearer token on each tool call. A code comment and ADR-001 both say the real login's claim name will replace this one (RD-5).",
